  "title": "Interviews | Orgiast - In-House Event &amp; Creative Production",
  "content_html": "<div id=\"contentsArea\">\n\n<section id=\"outline\" class=\"narrow\">\n<p>We feature interviews with clients from various industries who have used Orgiast's services. They discuss why they chose Orgiast for event production and creative work, what inspired them, and what they gained through the events.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"backnumber\" class=\"wide\">\n<h4 class=\"mb30\"><p>Back Issues</p></h4>\n<ul id=\"tiles\" class=\"tilesContents\">\n \n<li class=\"interview\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/パース図正面.png?fit=400%2C216&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/interview/7671\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2026-09-07</span></p>\n<h5>Interview with W2 Co., Ltd.</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"interview\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/DSC08620.jpg?fit=400%2C267&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/interview/6887\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2024-04-02</span></p>\n<h5>Interview with Outsourcing Technology Co., Ltd.</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"interview\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i0.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/interview_kidslabo230408_top.png?fit=400%2C262&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/interview/6763\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2023-11-29</span></p>\n<h5>Interview with Kids Lab Co., Ltd. - Hokkaido Ballpark Nursery School Opening Ceremony</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"interview\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i0.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/image-8.jpg?fit=400%2C300&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/interview/6563\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2023-02-15</span></p>\n<h5>Interview with Value Management Co., Ltd. - Remote Assistant System Introduction</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"interview\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i0.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/idoma_interview_01-min.jpg?fit=400%2C246&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/interview/5882\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2022-02-14</span></p>\n<h5>Interview with Yohei Miura, President of Aidma Holdings Co., Ltd.</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"interview\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/IMG_0931.jpg?fit=400%2C225&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/interview/4192\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2021-07-05</span></p>\n<h5>Interview with Astamuse Co., Ltd.</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"interview\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i2.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/1_森役員_安江.jpeg?fit=400%2C225&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/interview/4148\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2021-06-04</span></p>\n<h5>Special Interview with Mr. Mori of Light Tsushin Co., Ltd.</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"interview\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i2.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/スナップ-18.jpg?fit=400%2C266&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/interview/3739\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2020-12-24</span></p>\n<h5>Special Interview with Mr. Kobayashi, Representative Director &amp; President of Direct Marketing Mix Co., Ltd.</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"interview\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i2.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/070-1.jpg?fit=400%2C267&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/interview/2542\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2019-06-30</span></p>\n<h5>President Interview at Extolink Co., Ltd. &quot;14th Term Management Policy Presentation&quot;</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"interview\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i2.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/file_002_1.jpg?fit=400%2C338&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/interview/1717\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2018-06-17</span></p>\n<h5>Special Interview with Light Tsushin Co., Ltd.</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"interview\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/P_052.jpg?fit=400%2C267&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/interview/1159\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2017-07-07</span></p>\n<h5>Special Interview with Hirakawa Shoji Co., Ltd.</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"interview\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i0.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/ae46b1f460ee46f789c27b264a6cb421.jpg?fit=400%2C262&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/interview/262\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2013-04-19</span></p>\n<h5>Special Interview: Moroishi (諸石), Representative Director, Light Communication Co., Ltd.</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"interview\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/8089e50294910c6cb163e5cb54ad137b.jpg?fit=400%2C280&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/interview/265\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2013-04-01</span></p>\n<h5>Special Interview: Kubota (久保田), General Affairs Department, START Inc.</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n\n</div>",
